    "title": "PowerShell 编码命令执行",
    "severity": "high",
    "category": "host",
    "confidence": 0.82,
    "mitre": ["T1059.001"],
    "description": "出现 -enc/-EncodedCommand 或 FromBase64String，攻击者常用以规避命令行审计。",
    "match": {
      "any": [
        {"text": "regex:(?i)powershell(\\.exe)?[^\\n]{0,80}-(enc|encodedcommand)\\b"},
