    "title": "反弹 Shell",
    "severity": "critical",
    "category": "host",
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "mitre": ["T1059.004"],
    "description": "出现 /dev/tcp、nc -e、socat exec 等典型反弹 shell 命令。",
